{
  "nl": "开票管理（antd 风格）：查询有单据编号；表格展示单据编号、门店名称、开票主体、金额；支持新增、编辑、删除。表单里「开票主体」自动同步所选门店名称（未选门店时留空）。",
  "nlEn": "Invoicing management (Ant Design look): query by document no.; the table shows document no., store name, invoicing entity and amount; supports add, edit and delete. In the form the \"invoicing entity\" syncs to the chosen store name (left blank until a store is chosen).",
  "fixedFields": [
    "docNo",
    "storeName",
    "invoiceEntity",
    "amount"
  ],
  "pinnedDims": [
    "propSet",
    "actions",
    "reactions:invoiceEntity",
    "target"
  ],
  "nlStatedDims": ["propSet", "target", "actions", "reactions:invoiceEntity", "inQuery:docNo", "inTable:amount", "inTable:docNo", "inTable:invoiceEntity", "inTable:storeName"],
  "config": {
    "name": "InvoiceManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/invoices",
    "target": "antdv",
    "fields": [
      {
        "prop": "docNo",
        "label": "单据编号",
        "formtype": "Input"
      },
      {
        "prop": "storeName",
        "label": "门店名称",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "inQuery": false,
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "城西店",
            "value": "west"
          },
          {
            "label": "城东店",
            "value": "east"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "invoiceEntity",
        "label": "开票主体",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "inQuery": false,
        "reactions": [
          {
            "dependencies": [
              "storeName"
            ],
            "fulfill": {
              "value": {
                "var": "storeName"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "amount",
        "label": "金额",
        "formtype": "InputNumber",
        "inQuery": false
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit",
      "delete"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "AI-07: fulfill.value 自动同步（antdv/schema）。2026-11-02 去掉原稿的 `when: notEmpty(storeName)` 门控：NL 要求「未选门店时留空」，而 `{var:'storeName'}` 在门店清空时就求值为空串 —— 留空应由 value 表达式自己给出；`when` 门控反而会**跳过写入**、把上一家门店的名字留在字段里（stale），与 NL 相反"
}
